    "summary": "=============================================================================================================================\nLayer (type:depth-idx)                             Input Shape               Output Shape              Param #\n=============================================================================================================================\nHead                                               [2, 384]                  [2, 47]                   --\n\u251c\u2500GaussianNoise: 1-1                               [2, 384]                  [2, 384]                  --\n\u251c\u2500Serial: 1-2                                      [2, 384]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2514\u2500ModuleList: 2-1                             --                        --                        --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dense: 3-1                             [2, 384]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Sequential: 4-1                   [2, 384]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Linear: 5-1                  [2, 384]                  [2, 128]                  49,280\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Norm: 5-2                    [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500BatchNorm1d: 6-1        [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  256\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Activation: 5-3              [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500GELU: 6-2               [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dropout: 5-4                 [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dense: 3-2                             [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Sequential: 4-2                   [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Linear: 5-5                  [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  16,512\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Norm: 5-6                    [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500BatchNorm1d: 6-3        [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  256\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Activation: 5-7              [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500GELU: 6-4               [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dropout: 5-8                 [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dense: 3-3                             [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Sequential: 4-3                   [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Linear: 5-9                  [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  16,512\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Norm: 5-10                   [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500BatchNorm1d: 6-5        [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  256\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Activation: 5-11             [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500GELU: 6-6               [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dropout: 5-12                [2, 128]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u251c\u2500Projection: 1-3                                  [2, 384]                  [2, 128]                  --\n\u2502    \u2514\u2500Linear: 2-2                                 [2, 384]                  [2, 128]                  49,280\n\u251c\u2500Linear: 1-4                                      [2, 128]                  [2, 47]                   6,063\n=============================================================================================================================\nTotal params: 138,415\nTrainable params: 138,415\nNon-trainable params: 0\nTotal mult-adds (Units.MEGABYTES): 0.28\n=============================================================================================================================\nInput size (MB): 0.00\nForward/backward pass size (MB): 0.02\nParams size (MB): 0.55\nEstimated Total Size (MB): 0.57\n============================================================================================================================="
